I would tell you a joke about construction, but I am still working on it.
Time flies like an arrow. Fruit flies like a banana.
I am reading a book about anti-gravity. It is impossible to put down.
The graveyard is so crowded that people are dying to get in.
I wondered why the baseball was getting bigger. Then it hit me.
A bicycle cannot stand on its own because it is two tired.
I used to be a tailor, but I was not suited for it.
Did you hear about the claustrophobic astronaut? He just needed a little space.
I only know thirty-seven letters of the alphabet. I do not know y.
Why did the scarecrow win an award? He was outstanding in his field.
I tried to catch some fog yesterday. I mist.
When the clock factory closed, the workers said it was about time.
I am on a seafood diet. I see food and I eat it.
Why do seagulls fly over the sea? Because if they flew over the bay, they would be bagels.
I lost my job at the bakery because I could not make enough dough.
I do not trust stairs. They are always up to something.
A man crashed his car into a Santa suit shop. Police found him in a Santa Claus pile.
Why did the math book look so sad? It had too many problems.
What do you call cheese that is not yours? Nacho cheese.
Why do bees have sticky hair? Because they use honeycombs.
I got a job at a calendar factory, but I got fired for taking a few days off.
What did the ocean say to the beach? Nothing, it just waved.
The rotation of the earth really makes my day.
Why can you never trust an atom? They make up everything.
I told my wife she was drawing her eyebrows too high. She looked surprised.
How does a penguin build its house? Igloos it together.
Why was the broom late? It overswept.
I was going to make a pun about eggs, but it would be a bit over easy.
Why did the golfer bring two pairs of pants? In case he got a hole in one.
What do you call a bear with no teeth? A gummy bear.
Singing in the shower is fun until you get soap in your mouth. Then it is a soap opera.
What do you call a sleeping bull? A bulldozer.
Why are elevator jokes so good? They work on many levels.
My boss told me to have a good day, so I went home.
I am afraid for the calendar. Its days are numbered.
